Hey there! Welcome to my personal internet corner.

Building a portfolio and personal blog shouldn't be complicated or bloated. After exploring multiple approaches, combining **Astro** with a lightweight Git-based CMS (**Keystatic**) provides the sweet spot:

1. **Blazing Fast**: Static HTML with zero unused JavaScript.
1. **Easy Content Editing**: A visual CMS dashboard running directly in the browser.
1. **Full Content Ownership**: Everything is stored as plain Markdown/Markdoc files inside the Git repository.

### What to Expect Here

I will be sharing my technical explorations, code snippets, project case studies, and occasional random thoughts on software engineering and life.

Feel free to browse around or check out my [ships](/ships) to see what I'm currently building!
